6
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:15,380
And he was preaching the word to them.

7
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:19,980
And they came, bringing to him a paralytic carried by four men.

8
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:22,940
And when they could not get near him because of the crowd,

9
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:24,840
they removed the roof above him.

10
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:26,680
And when they had made an opening,

11
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:29,760
they let down the bed on which the paralytic lay.

12
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:33,360
And when Jesus saw their faith, he said to the paralytic,

13
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,720
Son, your sins are forgiven.

14
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:39,660
Now some of the scribes were sitting there,

15
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,520
