18
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:49,080
Who can forgive sins but God alone?

19
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:52,760
And immediately Jesus, perceiving in his spirit

20
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:54,920
that they thus questioned within themselves,

21
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:56,120
said to them,

22
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,400
Why do you question these things in your hearts?

23
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:02,580
Which is easier, to say to the paralytic,

24
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:03,920
Your sins are forgiven,

25
00:01:04,360 --> 00:01:05,400
or to say,

26
00:01:05,860 --> 00:01:07,900
Rise, take up your bed and walk,

27
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:10,860
but that you may know that the Son of Man

28
00:01:10,860 --> 00:01:13,240
