29
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:15,540
He said to the paralytic,

30
00:01:16,320 --> 00:01:17,260
I say to you,

31
00:01:17,620 --> 00:01:20,620
Rise, pick up your bed, and go home.

32
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:23,880
And he rose and immediately picked up his bed

33
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:25,600
